meta {
  name: 27 Technician - Approve (TAT STOP)
  type: http
  seq: 27
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/lab-reports/{{labReportId}}/approve
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{operatorToken}}
}

docs {
  **TAT 7 — Approve the report (⏱ TAT STOP).** RESULT_DONE → APPROVED. This stamps
  `approvedAt` — **the moment the Analytical-TAT clock stops** — and freezes the
  TAT snapshot (`tatStartAt` / `tatNetMinutes` / `tatMaxMinutes` / `tatBand`) onto
  the report. Read it back in steps 26–27.
}
